WEBVTT

00:03:28.163 --> 00:03:30.121
These are simple voice calls.

00:03:30.496 --> 00:03:32.204
As a typical doctor,

00:03:32.204 --> 00:03:34.496
I expected them to just inform

00:03:34.538 --> 00:03:37.704
and hopefully lead to better
health behaviors.

00:03:37.746 --> 00:03:41.954
However, the one unexpected
transformational benefit

00:03:41.996 --> 00:03:45.496
that has completely blown my mind is this:

00:03:45.496 --> 00:03:47.954
Information is empowerment.

00:03:48.288 --> 00:03:49.829
Armed with this information,

00:03:49.871 --> 00:03:53.996
women like Anita are upending
patriarchal family dynamics,

00:03:54.038 --> 00:03:56.454
challenging entrenched mores

00:03:56.496 --> 00:03:58.163
and demanding care.

00:03:58.538 --> 00:04:01.954
Karnam, the wife of a deeply
conservative preacher,